04, 1..60, Var, Group #1, Parameter Group, Active
04, 61..120, Var, Group #2, Parameter Group, Active
04, 121..170, Var, Group #3, Parameter Group,Active

.---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.Modbus Record Format
.              1           2              3             4                5                  6        7         8
.           Function,  Parameter No,   Signal_Type,     Name,         Description,      ,  Type,   Active,     Comment
. example      04,         1,            SubData,    Logic Status,  Logic status...,       Bits,   Not-Active,   blabla..

04, 1, SubData, Logic Status, Logic status of  HRVS-DN-PowerStart, Bits, Not-Active
04, 1, BitNo, 15, HRVS-DN-PowerStart Trip
04, 1, BitNo, 14, Motor Stopped
04, 1, BitNo, 13, Motor in Soft Stop Process
04, 1, BitNo, 12, Motor in Start Process
04, 1, BitNo, 11, Motor is Running
04, 1, BitNo, 10, Motor is running with Closed By_Pass
04, 1, BitNo, 09, Up_To_Speed. Like d10 and I reduced (once) below 115% of FLA
04, 1, BitNo, 07, Multi_Adjust#1 On.
04, 1, BitNo, 06, Multi_Adjust#2 On.
04, 1, BitNo, 05, Multi_Adjust#3 On.

04, 2, SubData, Hardwired inputs, Discrete Hardwired control inputs, Bits,  Not-Active
04, 2, BitNo, 07, Programmable Input#5 - Terminal 28
04, 2, BitNo, 06, Programmable Input#4 - Terminal 27
04, 2, BitNo, 05, Programmable Input#3 - Terminal 26
04, 2, BitNo, 04, Programmable Input#2 - Terminal 25
04, 2, BitNo, 03, Programmable Input#1 - Terminal 23
04, 2, BitNo, 02, Stop Input - Terminal 22
04, 2, BitNo, 01, Soft Stop Input, Terminal 21
04, 2, BitNo, 00, Start Input - Terminal 20

04, 3, SubData, Relays, Relay status,  Bits, Not-Active
04, 3, BitNo, 03, Fault relay (TRIP)
04, 3, BitNo, 02, End Of Acc
04, 3, BitNo, 01, Firing
04, 3, BitNo, 00, Immediate

04, 4, UInt16, Voltage, Line voltage, Volt, Not-Active

04, 5, UInt16, I1_amp, Current of phase 1, Ampere, Not-Active

04, 6, UInt16, I2_amp, Current of phase 2, Ampere, Not-Active

04, 7, UInt16, I3_amp, Current of phase 3, Ampere, Not-Active

04, 10, SubData, Phase_Sequence, Phase_Sequence, Val, Not-Active
04, 10, Val, 00, Wrong Phase Seq
04, 10, Val, 01, Correct Phase seq

04, 12, UInt16, V1, Line voltage of phase 1, Volt, Not-Active
04, 13, UInt16, V2, Line voltage of phase 2, Volt, Not-Active
04, 14, UInt16, V3, Line voltage of phase 3, Volt, Not-Active

04, 15, UInt16, Power, Power consumption, KW, Not-Active
04, 16, UInt16, Reactive Power, Reactive Power consumption, KVAR, Not-Active
04, 17, UInt16, Power Factor, Power Factor * 100, %, Not-Active
04, 18, UInt16, Time Since Last Start, Elapsed minutes since last start, Sec, Not-Active
04, 19, UInt16, Frequency, Frequency, tenth Hz, Not-Active

04, 20, UInt16, PreTrip_VA, Voltage of phase 1 at the last trip, Not-Active, Volt
04, 21, UInt16, PreTrip_VB, Voltage of phase 2 at the last trip, Not-Active, Volt
04, 22, UInt16, PreTrip_VC, Voltage of phase 3 at the last trip, Not-Active, Volt
04, 23, UInt16, RTC_Low_Word, LSW of the Real Time Clock value, Not-Active, Milliseconds
04, 24, UInt16, RTC_High_Word, MSW of the Real Time Clock value, Not-Active, Milliseconds
04, 25, UInt16, Logic_Status_at_Power_Fail, Logic Status at Control Pwr Supply turn off, Bits, Not-Active, See parameter  # 1 for detailed description

04, 26, UInt16, Total_Run_Time, Total Hours  of  Running Motor, Hours, Not-Active
